    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n3176" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ap-plumbo</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">adp-</span></b> ), āre, v. a.,
